  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/255308/description_c4372955-c8ad-4b7f-b5a6-7696cca9bfad.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"262\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/commits-since/Gilded-Games/The-Aether/1.14.4-0.0.1?color=22272E&amp;label=commits&amp;logo=github&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/Gilded-Games/The-Aether?color=22272E&amp;label=issues&amp;logo=github&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-pr-raw/Gilded-Games/The-Aether?color=22272E&amp;label=pull requests&amp;logo=github&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&amp;type=pledges&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=7289DA&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.aether.devaether.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/crowdin-aether-blue?color=55BC5C&amp;label=crowdin&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&amp;logoSource=feather&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&amp;label=youtube&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&amp;label=reddit&amp;logo=reddit&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 關於Aether ☁️<br></strong></span></h2><p>Aether團隊為您呈獻原版Aether模組！本模組持續維護更新，支援最新Minecraft版本，並完全相容多人遊戲！</p><p>Aether圍繞著高聳雲霄的維度展開，充滿了<strong>遼闊雲海</strong>與<strong>浮空島嶼</strong>。這個維度擁有全新的生存冒險體驗，以類似原版的<strong>生存進度</strong>為基礎，包含<strong>新礦物</strong>、<strong>神話生物</strong>，以及<strong>三個險峻的地牢</strong>，每個地牢都有其獨特的<strong>強大戰利品</strong>。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 模組內容 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>Aether包含許多新的簡易功能，大部分在<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1275355-1-7-3-aether-collaboration-mod-v1-02-new-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Collaboration Mod</a>的原始論壇文章中已有說明。以下是內容的簡要概述：</p><ul>\n<li>天空中的敵對天堂：Aether維度！小心別掉下去，否則你會回到主世界。</li>\n<li>來自該維度的各種新方塊與物品。</li>\n<li>3個實用方塊：祭壇、冷凍器、孵化器。</li>\n<li>4種材料等級：Skyroot、Holystone、Zanite和Gravitite，每種都有獨特能力的工具與武器。</li>\n<li>傳說之書，包含模組中每個方塊與物品的條目。</li>\n<li>獨特GUI的飾品系統，讓你能使用發現的戰利品。</li>\n<li>類似主世界及Aether獨有的生物。</li>\n<li>Moas：一種飛行坐騎生物，有不同等級的跳躍次數。</li>\n<li>3個可征服的新結構：青銅、銀與金地牢，各有其裝備可掠奪和首領可擊敗。</li>\n<li>永恆白晝，只有在征服最終地牢後才能結束，之後可使用獨特的實用方塊——太陽祭壇控制晝夜循環。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252faether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/255308/description_b9ff2a53-d0c1-4bb9-b5a1-fe05b6e238ec.png\"></a></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"> </pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 入門指南 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>要開始Aether之旅，你必須用<strong>螢光石框架</strong>建造一個傳送門，並在中央用<strong>水桶</strong>點亮它。這會啟動傳送門，讓你能夠步入並進入該維度。從這裡開始，你可以在Aether的敵對天堂中展開生存！</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"387\"></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 征服地牢 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>Aether的世界包含三個新的神秘地牢，每個都有一個可怕的頭目等待擊敗...</p><p><strong>青銅地牢</strong>是哨兵的家園，由令人不安的<strong>Slider</strong>守護，這是一種純粹由石頭構成的生物。留意島嶼間的隱藏隧道，並用你能製作的最佳裝備做好準備！</p><p><strong>銀地牢</strong>是美麗的瓦爾基里神殿。挑戰瓦爾基里騎士團的騎士，如果證明了自己的價值，則可與<strong>瓦爾基里女王</strong>本人戰鬥。運用你能想到的所有工具和技巧來擊敗這位遠古戰士。</p><p>在罕見的<strong>金地牢</strong>中，沉睡著<strong>太陽精靈</strong>，一個純粹由火焰與能量構成的永恆存在。他是統治太陽本身的神祇，要讓他注意到像你這樣的存在需要耗費一番功夫。但據傳言，他守護著Aether中一些最棒的寶藏。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"356\"></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 即將推出 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faetherlegends.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/refs/heads/main/images/legends.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"7680\" height=\"2160\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 加入討論 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>快來加入我們的Discord伺服器，與超過10,000名成員的活躍社群交流！</p><p>有問題想問開發者？需要協助設定模組？發現錯誤？我們有專門的Aether模組支援和開發頻道！或者只是想聊聊模組，或在我們的官方伺服器上組織遊戲？Aether Discord是你的不二之選！我們友善的工作人員和熱情的社群會讓你感覺賓至如歸！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 支持Aether團隊 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>沒有你的支持，就無法打造Aether。請考慮捐款贊助開發！每一筆捐款都直接用於開發，使我們能夠繼續做我們最熱愛的事。<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 貢獻專案 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>想為Aether模組做出貢獻嗎？Aether是開源的，意味著任何有興趣的人都可以貢獻程式碼來幫助專案！更多資訊可以在我們的<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/README.md#wrench-contribute-to-the-project\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub儲存庫</a>中找到。</p><p>我們也透過<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.aether.devaether.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>接受專案的翻譯，讓更多玩家能夠享受Aether！</p><p>我們的<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/README.md#speech_balloon-translations\" rel=\"nofollow\">翻譯</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/CREDITS.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">程式碼貢獻</a>致謝名單都可以在我們的GitHub儲存庫中找到。</p>",
